            <div xml:id="d113-a4">

                <pb facs="0267" n="171" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg171"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 172.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>We are assured by a very responsible merchant of Guayaquil, that the statement
                    made in our last issue that the leading merchants of that city had compromised
                    themselves to give all their business to the new French line in preference to
                    the English company, is not correct, and that no such compromise has been made.
                    We received our information from what we considered a perfectly reliable source,
                    and now gladly make this correction as requested.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
